{"1":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أُوحِيَ","d":"ūḥiya","e":"It has been revealed"},{"c":"إِلَيَّ","d":"ilayya","e":"to me"},{"c":"أَنَّهُ","d":"annahu","e":"that"},{"c":"اسْتَمَعَ","d":"is'tamaʿa","e":"listened"},{"c":"نَفَرٌ","d":"nafarun","e":"a group"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْجِنِّ","d":"l-jini","e":"the jinn"},{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"and they said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"سَمِعْنَا","d":"samiʿ'nā","e":"heard"},{"c":"قُرْءَانًا","d":"qur'ānan","e":"a Quran"},{"c":"عَجَبًا","d":"ʿajaban","e":"amazing"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur'an."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"يَهْدِي","d":"yahdī","e":"It guides"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"الرُّشْدِ","d":"l-rush'di","e":"the right way"},{"c":"فَءَامَنَّا","d":"faāmannā","e":"so we believe"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in it"},{"c":"وَلَنْ","d":"walan","e":"and never"},{"c":"نُشْرِكَ","d":"nush'rika","e":"we will associate"},{"c":"بِرَبِّنَا","d":"birabbinā","e":"with our Lord"},{"c":"أَحَدًا","d":"aḥadan","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"It guides to the right course, and we have believed in it. And we will never associate with our Lord anyone."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّهُ","d":"wa-annahu","e":"And that He"},{"c":"تَعَالَى","d":"taʿālā","e":"Exalted is"},{"c":"جَدُّ","d":"jaddu","e":"(the) Majesty"},{"c":"رَبِّنَا","d":"rabbinā","e":"(of) our Lord"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"اتَّخَذَ","d":"ittakhadha","e":"He has taken"},{"c":"صَاحِبَةً","d":"ṣāḥibatan","e":"a wife"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"وَلَدًا","d":"waladan","e":"a son"}],"a":{"g":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّهُ","d":"wa-annahu","e":"And that he"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"used"},{"c":"يَقُولُ","d":"yaqūlu","e":"(to) speak"},{"c":"سَفِيهُنَا","d":"safīhunā","e":"the foolish among us"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"against"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"شَطَطًا","d":"shaṭaṭan","e":"an excessive transgression"}],"a":{"g":"And that our foolish one has been saying about Allah an excessive transgression."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"ظَنَنَّا","d":"ẓanannā","e":"thought"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"تَقُولَ","d":"taqūla","e":"will say"},{"c":"الْإِنْسُ","d":"l-insu","e":"the men"},{"c":"وَالْجِنُّ","d":"wal-jinu","e":"and the jinn"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"against"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"كَذِبًا","d":"kadhiban","e":"any lie"}],"a":{"g":"And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allah a lie."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّهُ","d":"wa-annahu","e":"And that"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"(there) were"},{"c":"رِجَالٌ","d":"rijālun","e":"men"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْإِنْسِ","d":"l-insi","e":"mankind"},{"c":"يَعُوذُونَ","d":"yaʿūdhūna","e":"who sought refuge"},{"c":"بِرِجَالٍ","d":"birijālin","e":"in (the) men"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْجِنِّ","d":"l-jini","e":"the jinn"},{"c":"فَزَادُوهُمْ","d":"fazādūhum","e":"so they increased them"},{"c":"رَهَقًا","d":"rahaqan","e":"(in) burden"}],"a":{"g":"And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"wa-annahum","e":"And that they"},{"c":"ظَنُّوا","d":"ẓannū","e":"thought"},{"c":"كَمَا","d":"kamā","e":"as"},{"c":"ظَنَنْتُمْ","d":"ẓanantum","e":"you thought"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"يَبْعَثَ","d":"yabʿatha","e":"will raise"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَحَدًا","d":"aḥadan","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"And they had thought, as you thought, that Allah would never send anyone [as a messenger]."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"لَمَسْنَا","d":"lamasnā","e":"sought to touch"},{"c":"السَّمَاءَ","d":"l-samāa","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"فَوَجَدْنَاهَا","d":"fawajadnāhā","e":"but we found it"},{"c":"مُلِئَتْ","d":"muli-at","e":"filled (with)"},{"c":"حَرَسًا","d":"ḥarasan","e":"guards"},{"c":"شَدِيدًا","d":"shadīdan","e":"severe"},{"c":"وَشُهُبًا","d":"washuhuban","e":"and flaming fires"}],"a":{"g":"And we have sought [to reach] the heaven but found it filled with powerful guards and burning flames."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"used (to)"},{"c":"نَقْعُدُ","d":"naqʿudu","e":"sit"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"there in"},{"c":"مَقَاعِدَ","d":"maqāʿida","e":"positions"},{"c":"لِلسَّمْعِ","d":"lilssamʿi","e":"for hearing"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"but (he) who"},{"c":"يَسْتَمِعِ","d":"yastamiʿi","e":"listens"},{"c":"الْءَانَ","d":"l-āna","e":"now"},{"c":"يَجِدْ","d":"yajid","e":"will find"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"شِهَابًا","d":"shihāban","e":"a flaming fire"},{"c":"رَصَدًا","d":"raṣadan","e":"waiting"}],"a":{"g":"And we used to sit therein in positions for hearing, but whoever listens now will find a burning flame lying in wait for him."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"نَدْرِي","d":"nadrī","e":"we know"},{"c":"أَشَرٌّ","d":"asharrun","e":"whether evil"},{"c":"أُرِيدَ","d":"urīda","e":"is intended"},{"c":"بِمَنْ","d":"biman","e":"for (those) who"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"أَرَادَ","d":"arāda","e":"intends"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"for them"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"رَشَدًا","d":"rashadan","e":"a right path"}],"a":{"g":"And we do not know [therefore] whether evil is intended for those on earth or whether their Lord intends for them a right course."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"among us"},{"c":"الصَّالِحُونَ","d":"l-ṣāliḥūna","e":"(are) the righteous"},{"c":"وَمِنَّا","d":"waminnā","e":"and among us"},{"c":"دُونَ","d":"dūna","e":"(are) other than"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"We"},{"c":"طَرَائِقَ","d":"ṭarāiqa","e":"(are on) ways"},{"c":"قِدَدًا","d":"qidadan","e":"different"}],"a":{"g":"And among us are the righteous, and among us are [others] not so; we were [of] divided ways."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"ظَنَنَّا","d":"ẓanannā","e":"[we] have become certain"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"نُعجِزَ","d":"nuʿ'jiza","e":"we will cause failure"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"(to) Allah"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَلَنْ","d":"walan","e":"and never"},{"c":"نُعْجِزَهُ","d":"nuʿ'jizahu","e":"we can escape Him"},{"c":"هَرَبًا","d":"haraban","e":"(by) flight"}],"a":{"g":"And we have become certain that we will never cause failure to Allah upon earth, nor can we escape Him by flight."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"سَمِعْنَا","d":"samiʿ'nā","e":"we heard"},{"c":"الْهُدَى","d":"l-hudā","e":"the Guidance"},{"c":"ءَامَنَّا","d":"āmannā","e":"we believed"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in it"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنْ","d":"yu'min","e":"believes"},{"c":"بِرَبِّهِ","d":"birabbihi","e":"in his Lord"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then not"},{"c":"يَخَافُ","d":"yakhāfu","e":"he will fear"},{"c":"بَخْسًا","d":"bakhsan","e":"any loss"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"رَهَقًا","d":"rahaqan","e":"any burden"}],"a":{"g":"And when we heard the guidance, we believed in it. And whoever believes in his Lord will not fear deprivation or burden."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّا","d":"wa-annā","e":"And that we"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"among us"},{"c":"الْمُسْلِمُونَ","d":"l-mus'limūna","e":"(are) Muslims"},{"c":"وَمِنَّا","d":"waminnā","e":"and among us"},{"c":"الْقَاسِطُونَ","d":"l-qāsiṭūna","e":"(are) unjust"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"أَسْلَمَ","d":"aslama","e":"submits"},{"c":"فَأُولَئِكَ","d":"fa-ulāika","e":"then those"},{"c":"تَحَرَّوْا","d":"taḥarraw","e":"have sought"},{"c":"رَشَدًا","d":"rashadan","e":"(the) right path"}],"a":{"g":"And among us are Muslims [in submission to Allah], and among us are the unjust. And whoever has become Muslim - those have sought out the right course."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"And as for"},{"c":"الْقَاسِطُونَ","d":"l-qāsiṭūna","e":"the unjust"},{"c":"فَكَانُوا","d":"fakānū","e":"they will be"},{"c":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","d":"lijahannama","e":"for Hell"},{"c":"حَطَبًا","d":"ḥaṭaban","e":"firewood"}],"a":{"g":"But as for the unjust, they will be, for Hell, firewood.'"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَلَّوِ","d":"wa-allawi","e":"And if"},{"c":"اسْتَقَامُوا","d":"is'taqāmū","e":"they had remained"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الطَّرِيقَةِ","d":"l-ṭarīqati","e":"the Way"},{"c":"لَأَسْقَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"la-asqaynāhum","e":"surely We (would) have given them to drink"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"غَدَقًا","d":"ghadaqan","e":"(in) abundance"}],"a":{"g":"And [Allah revealed] that if they had remained straight on the way, We would have given them abundant provision"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"لِنَفْتِنَهُمْ","d":"linaftinahum","e":"That We might test them"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يُعْرِضْ","d":"yuʿ'riḍ","e":"turns away"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"ذِكْرِ","d":"dhik'ri","e":"the Remembrance"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"(of) his Lord"},{"c":"يَسْلُكْهُ","d":"yasluk'hu","e":"He will make him enter"},{"c":"عَذَابًا","d":"ʿadhāban","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"صَعَدًا","d":"ṣaʿadan","e":"severe"}],"a":{"g":"So We might test them therein. And whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord He will put into arduous punishment."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّ","d":"wa-anna","e":"And that"},{"c":"الْمَسَاجِدَ","d":"l-masājida","e":"the masajid"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"(are) for Allah"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"so (do) not"},{"c":"تَدْعُوا","d":"tadʿū","e":"call"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَحَدًا","d":"aḥadan","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"And [He revealed] that the masjids are for Allah, so do not invoke with Allah anyone."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّهُ","d":"wa-annahu","e":"And that"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"قَامَ","d":"qāma","e":"stood up"},{"c":"عَبْدُ","d":"ʿabdu","e":"(the) slave"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"يَدْعُوهُ","d":"yadʿūhu","e":"calling (upon) Him"},{"c":"كَادُوا","d":"kādū","e":"they almost"},{"c":"يَكُونُونَ","d":"yakūnūna","e":"became"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"around him"},{"c":"لِبَدًا","d":"libadan","e":"a compacted mass"}],"a":{"g":"And that when the Servant of Allah stood up supplicating Him, they almost became about him a compacted mass.\""}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَدْعُوا","d":"adʿū","e":"I call upon"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"my Lord"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أُشْرِكُ","d":"ush'riku","e":"I associate"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with Him"},{"c":"أَحَدًا","d":"aḥadan","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I only invoke my Lord and do not associate with Him anyone.\""}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"أَمْلِكُ","d":"amliku","e":"possess"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"ضَرًّا","d":"ḍarran","e":"any harm"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"رَشَدًا","d":"rashadan","e":"right path"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Indeed, I do not possess for you [the power of] harm or right direction.\""}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"يُجِيرَنِي","d":"yujīranī","e":"can protect me"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"},{"c":"وَلَنْ","d":"walan","e":"and never"},{"c":"أَجِدَ","d":"ajida","e":"can I find"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"دُونِهِ","d":"dūnihi","e":"besides Him"},{"c":"مُلْتَحَدًا","d":"mul'taḥadan","e":"any refuge"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Indeed, there will never protect me from Allah anyone [if I should disobey], nor will I find in other than Him a refuge."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"But"},{"c":"بَلَاغًا","d":"balāghan","e":"(the) notification"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَرِسَالَاتِهِ","d":"warisālātihi","e":"and His Messages"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يَعْصِ","d":"yaʿṣi","e":"disobeys"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَرَسُولَهُ","d":"warasūlahu","e":"and His Messenger"},{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"then indeed"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"نَارَ","d":"nāra","e":"(is the) Fire"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"(of) Hell"},{"c":"خَالِدِينَ","d":"khālidīna","e":"(they will) abide"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"أَبَدًا","d":"abadan","e":"forever"}],"a":{"g":"But [I have for you] only notification from Allah, and His messages.\" And whoever disobeys Allah and His Messenger - then indeed, for him is the fire of Hell; they will abide therein forever."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"Until"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"رَأَوْا","d":"ra-aw","e":"they see"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يُوعَدُونَ","d":"yūʿadūna","e":"they are promised"},{"c":"فَسَيَعْلَمُونَ","d":"fasayaʿlamūna","e":"then they will know"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"أَضْعَفُ","d":"aḍʿafu","e":"(is) weaker"},{"c":"نَاصِرًا","d":"nāṣiran","e":"(in) helpers"},{"c":"وَأَقَلُّ","d":"wa-aqallu","e":"and fewer"},{"c":"عَدَدًا","d":"ʿadadan","e":"(in) number"}],"a":{"g":"[The disbelievers continue] until, when they see that which they are promised, then they will know who is weaker in helpers and less in number."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَدْرِي","d":"adrī","e":"I know"},{"c":"أَقَرِيبٌ","d":"aqarībun","e":"whether is near"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you are promised"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or (whether)"},{"c":"يَجْعَلُ","d":"yajʿalu","e":"will appoint"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for it"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"my Lord"},{"c":"أَمَدًا","d":"amadan","e":"a (distant) term"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"I do not know if what you are promised is near or if my Lord will grant for it a [long] period.\""}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"عَالِمُ","d":"ʿālimu","e":"(The) All-Knower"},{"c":"الْغَيْبِ","d":"l-ghaybi","e":"(of) the unseen"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"so not"},{"c":"يُظْهِرُ","d":"yuẓ'hiru","e":"He reveals"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"from"},{"c":"غَيْبِهِ","d":"ghaybihi","e":"His unseen"},{"c":"أَحَدًا","d":"aḥadan","e":"(to) anyone"}],"a":{"g":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"whom"},{"c":"ارْتَضَى","d":"ir'taḍā","e":"He has approved"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رَسُولٍ","d":"rasūlin","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"فَإِنَّهُ","d":"fa-innahu","e":"and indeed, He"},{"c":"يَسْلُكُ","d":"yasluku","e":"makes to march"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"بَيْنِ","d":"bayni","e":"before"},{"c":"يَدَيْهِ","d":"yadayhi","e":"him"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and from"},{"c":"خَلْفِهِ","d":"khalfihi","e":"behind him"},{"c":"رَصَدًا","d":"raṣadan","e":"a guard"}],"a":{"g":"Except whom He has approved of messengers, and indeed, He sends before each messenger and behind him observers"}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَعْلَمَ","d":"liyaʿlama","e":"That He may make evident"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"indeed"},{"c":"أَبْلَغُوا","d":"ablaghū","e":"they have conveyed"},{"c":"رِسَالَاتِ","d":"risālāti","e":"(the) Messages"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord;"},{"c":"وَأَحَاطَ","d":"wa-aḥāṭa","e":"and He has encompassed"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"what"},{"c":"لَدَيْهِمْ","d":"ladayhim","e":"(is) with them"},{"c":"وَأَحْصَى","d":"wa-aḥṣā","e":"and He takes account"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"(of) all"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"things"},{"c":"عَدَدًا","d":"ʿadadan","e":"(in) number"}],"a":{"g":"That he may know that they have conveyed the messages of their Lord; and He has encompassed whatever is with them and has enumerated all things in number."}}}